
# My Cafe Website

## About
My Cafe is a simple and attractive cafe website created as part of Lab 12.

## Website Pages
- Home – Introduction to My Cafe.
- Menu – Displays food and drinks.
- Gallery – Shows food and drinks pictures.
- Contact – Provides contact information and opening hours.

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS

## Website Theme
- Background: Cream (#f5eee6)
- Headings: Brown (#654321)
- Text: Dark Grey (#333333)
- Font: Arial

